1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,800
Nora has a repaired analysis to review.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,297
Would you approve it?

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,033
Two patches.

4
00:00:06,033 --> 00:00:06,887
Same total.

5
00:00:06,887 --> 00:00:08,167
One is wrong.

6
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,642
This repair returns the expected total.

7
00:00:11,642 --> 00:00:15,335
But watch what happens when we check the evidence.

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,926
Every pair is different.

9
00:00:20,926 --> 00:00:22,235
The headline matches.

10
00:00:22,235 --> 00:00:23,981
The evidence does not.

11
00:00:23,981 --> 00:00:27,473
A total-only check would miss this wrong repair.

12
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,987
Now the declared repair.

13
00:00:31,987 --> 00:00:33,343
Same total again.

14
00:00:33,343 --> 00:00:36,054
This time, all four pairs agree.

15
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,457
The code passed.

16
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:44,286
The original three point four zero claim did not.

17
00:00:44,286 --> 00:00:45,989
Those are separate decisions.

18
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:52,824
Given the declared channel convention, NVIDIA Nemotron on Nebius

19
00:00:52,824 --> 00:00:55,920
Token Factory proposed two parameter arrays.

20
00:00:55,920 --> 00:01:00,563
It translated the convention; it did not discover it.

21
00:01:00,563 --> 00:01:03,143
Counts and tests stayed protected.

22
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:09,154
One recorded Nebius Sandbox operation tested all three variants.

23
00:01:09,154 --> 00:01:10,812
The repair passed.

24
00:01:10,812 --> 00:01:13,575
Both controls failed as expected.

25
00:01:13,575 --> 00:01:15,786
Guest networking was disabled.

26
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:20,565
When evidence is missing, LabRepair asks for review.

27
00:01:20,565 --> 00:01:24,796
It does not fill the gap with a confident answer.

28
00:01:24,796 --> 00:01:27,335
This is a curated local control.

29
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:32,506
Nora records a hold against this exact source.

30
00:01:32,506 --> 00:01:35,416
Her decision preserves the checks and reasons.

31
00:01:35,416 --> 00:01:37,494
It launches no new job.

32
00:01:37,494 --> 00:01:41,235
The evidence receipt is ready for the next reviewer.

33
00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:47,609
She can hand over what changed, what failed, and

34
00:01:47,609 --> 00:01:49,577
what still needs evidence.

35
00:01:49,577 --> 00:01:54,497
One synthetic case, with recorded real generation and isolated execution.

36
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:56,776
LabRepair.

37
00:01:56,776 --> 00:01:58,566
Repair the analysis.

38
00:01:58,566 --> 00:02:00,355
Preserve the evidence.
